// ── Extension: ActivePowerControl (on any Injection) ─────────────────────────
// ACTIVE_POWER_CONTROL is the extension's type code: getRelated(injection, ACTIVE_POWER_CONTROL)
// gives the extension object (INVALID_HANDLE when absent), on which the EXT_APC_* codes apply;
// invoke(injection, ACTIVE_POWER_CONTROL) starts its adder; setRelated(injection,
// ACTIVE_POWER_CONTROL, INVALID_HANDLE) removes it.
